     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>To help you with queries about our products or to be even more effective in case of possible problems, we can offer you the option of linking to your computer Live per Remote.</strong></p> <p>Please note that this is only possible by appointment. Please contact</p> <p>for Measuring Machines / External Tool Management <br/><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://zoller-group.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/44\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Request Service\">Request Service</a></p> <p>for TMS Tool Management Solutions <br/><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://zoller-group.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/7\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Request Support\">Request Support</a></p> <p>Should you experience difficulties when downloading or executing the ZOLLER Online Support applications, this could be caused by blocking by your system administrator. In this case, please contact your local administrator. Your administrator may also be able to offer you an alternative option.</p>",
      "images": [],
